# XBD <setjmp.h>
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#
# The array types of <setjmp.h>. Each says why it has no mutant yet.

assertion  XBD.setjmp.h.001
anchor     basedefs/setjmp.h.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      1988
says       jmp_buf and sigjmp_buf are array types: an object of either type
           designates the same address as the address of its first element, and
           one can be passed as a function parameter (where it becomes a
           pointer).
test       t/001-array-types.c
nomutant   compile-time check; needs the Tier 0 header mutants
